: "1422000019544005", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617847_1422000022877338_4934907452008701958_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F1gbVac40IAQ7kNvwErJJpE&_nc_oc=AdqFbuUTJDaVfg48NSd4vukb_GsW4um0sFM3iFzjNk9O7036eZz7FKfT-4QMzP-4WZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4qC7ip_Fnmy4ogrJq6Qmdu_cQZgYFu3SgWoGgm0SBNUg&oe=6A19B6DA"}, {"file_name": "com.ngua.vrbase-20260213-135444.png", "id": "1311751187378587", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620860_1311751190711920_6734640459296736948_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B4tuxDmrl8wQ7kNvwEHF1QV&_nc_oc=AdonV3cy0aY1tv8dqmW1Xl6Url1RwJ3qJkTjPpkw-wSjB8p66fmwGHco1Txa8jxQ5zw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4K-qX6HZY9Q_3tiy5U8jD2S00XvP0bBDF22sBSWez8nQ&oe=6A19B1A5"}, {"file_name": "com.ngua.vrbase-20260213-135519.png", "id": "1174740887833336", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620429_1174740891166669_5595007207827676095_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Iw1ysckW5kYQ7kNvwGINJ6B&_nc_oc=AdpQHASmfY97pDs6S9UVF0-1XvU3ZKM_u3LYJwZipaGoNKx0uh-thtLnI8-Dwfr8Ltw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5pTZ3aRvzpjaCuRZHpIFaDRI2CmPA4S7FcULLASISGmQ&oe=6A19A3B5"}, {"file_name": "com.ngua.vrbase-20260213-135322.png", "id": "1224827645925130", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622334_1224827649258463_6492821264806372627_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fc-6SWlIvXEQ7kNvwFj-vfh&_nc_oc=AdqKynagDzyyXufRsybBP1nuIjt6VMSqVszZEFc149YiyYlDCuJHAJAIJ3lN_FI-eMw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af64yjZRsyAR_66nQGleIF0A0DnnNjEhkFV1pgZ7At59KA&oe=6A199A06"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ball Blitz VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to Ball Blitz VR - the ultimate virtual reality bowling experience!\n\n\ud83c\udfb3 GAMEPLAY\nStep into a stunning VR bowling alley and experience the thrill of the perfect strike. Use intuitive hand-tracking controls to pick up, aim, and roll your ball with precision. Feel the satisfying impact as pins scatter across the lane!\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 FEATURES\n\u2022 10 Unique Levels - Progress through increasingly challenging stages\n\u2022 Star Rating System - Earn 1-3 stars based on your performance\n\u2022 Level Unlock - Master each level to unlock the next challenge\n\u2022 Ball Skins - Customize your ball with unlockable designs\n\u2022 Power-ups - Grab Multi-Ball, Explosive, and Slow-Time boosts\n\u2022 Global Leaderboard - Compete with players worldwide\n\u2022 Stats Tracking - Monitor your progress and high scores\n\u2022 Immersive Sound Effects - Realistic bowling sounds\n\n\ud83c\udfae CONTROLS\nDesigned for Meta Quest hand-tracking. Simply reach out, grab the ball, and throw naturally!\n\n\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 FOR EVERYONE\nEasy to learn, challenging to master. Perfect for VR beginners and bowling enthusiasts alike.\n\nDownload now and become the Ball Blitz champion!", "short_description": "Roll, aim, and knock down pins in this immersive VR bowling adventure! Master 10 challenging levels, unlock stylish ball skins, grab powerful power-ups, and climb the global leaderboard. With intuitive hand-tracking controls and stunning visuals, Ball Blitz VR delivers arcade fun in virtual reality. Perfect for players of all skill levels!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ball-blitz-vr.pages.dev/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NVR Labs", "support_website_url": "https://ball-blitz-vr.pages.dev/support.html", "website_url": "https://ball-blitz-vr.pages.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": 